{"id": "t161-001", "text": "Heather rang this morning. She's finally found a flat in Leeds and moves in sometime next month. I should send her a plant for the new place once she's settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Heather", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "found a flat in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a plant for the new place", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's settled", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-002", "text": "Ravi and his wife Ana are viewing a two-bed in Walthamstow on Saturday at 11. They're hoping to put an offer in the same day if it's any good. Ana is keen on it because it's near her work, but Ravi thinks the second bedroom is basically a cupboard. They've already lost two places this month to cash buyers, so they're both a bit fed up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing a two-bed in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "keen", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this month"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t161-003", "text": "Joe's driving test is on Thursday at 2pm and he's really nervous about the roundabouts. Remind me to text him good luck that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the roundabouts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-004", "text": "Coffee with Yaw. He's thinking of moving back to Accra in the spring, though nothing is decided yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yaw", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Accra", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-005", "text": "Francesca's housewarming has been called off because the boiler packed in. She says she'll do something after Christmas instead, once the flat is warm again.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do something", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the flat is warm again", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-006", "text": "Julia mentioned her mum is having a hip operation on the 12th at half 9. Need to ring Julia the next day to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Julia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-007", "text": "Suzanne is vegetarian and doesn't drink coffee, only green tea.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink coffee, only green tea", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t161-008", "text": "Olivia said she'd love a decent cast iron pan. Hers cracked in the move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent cast iron pan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t161-009", "text": "Pick up the spare keys from the letting agent tomorrow morning before 10.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up the spare keys from the letting agent", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning before 10", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-010", "text": "Beatriz Reyes starts her new job at the museum on Monday. She's been worrying about the commute from Croydon. Must message her on Monday evening to ask how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Beatriz Reyes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the museum", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worrying about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-011", "text": "Long call with Fatima tonight. Her brother Ivan is moving to Berlin at the end of the month for a research post, and the family are throwing him a leaving dinner on the Friday before he goes. She's struggling a bit because he's the one who usually helps with their dad. I should check in with her a week after he leaves, and maybe send Ivan a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Berlin", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "research post", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before he goes", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after he leaves", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Ivan a card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t161-012", "text": "Darius and Reza got engaged last weekend! The party will be sometime in the summer, probably in Bristol.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the summer", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t161-013", "text": "Kenji's cat Miso went missing on Tuesday. He found her the next day hiding in the neighbour's shed, very pleased with herself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Miso", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbour", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-014", "text": "Remind me to ask Siddharth how the flat viewing in Manchester went. It was yesterday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Siddharth how the flat viewing in Manchester went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat viewing in Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-015", "text": "Matilda's daughter graduates from Edinburgh on 3 July at 10am. Matilda is driving up the night before and staying until the Sunday afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 July at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the Sunday afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-016", "text": "Tomás said he might come and visit soon, possibly around half term. Nothing firm yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "come and visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around half term", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-017", "text": "Alessia is allergic to nuts and sesame, and she can't stand coriander.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alessia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts and sesame", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand coriander", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t161-018", "text": "Kiara is moving in with her boyfriend in March. She's excited but a bit anxious about leaving the house share.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious about leaving the house share", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t161-019", "text": "Petra's dog Bruno has his operation on Friday morning. She's dropping him at the vet at 8 and collecting him that evening. Don't forget to text her afterwards. She's been really anxious about it because he's nearly twelve and the vet was honest about the risks with the anaesthetic. Her mum is going with her to collect him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bruno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-020", "text": "Hannah and Emeka are having a baby! Due sometime in early spring. Their little boy is going to be a big brother and apparently has opinions about names already.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emeka", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having a baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early spring", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t161-021", "text": "Rana called. Her dad passed away on Sunday and the funeral is next Thursday at 1pm. I need to send flowers the day before and ask whether she wants company afterwards. Her brother is flying back from Toronto on Tuesday to help sort things out, and she's staying at her mum's for the rest of the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask whether she wants company", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Toronto", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the week"}]}
{"id": "t161-022", "text": "Sunil got the flat in Glasgow! He gets the keys on the 28th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat in Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gets the keys", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t161-023", "text": "I'm going to Barbara's for lunch on Sunday at 1 and bringing dessert.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t161-024", "text": "Antoine Dubois mentioned he's into bouldering and goes to the wall in Bermondsey most Tuesdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine Dubois", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes to the wall in Bermondsey", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most Tuesdays"}]}
{"id": "t161-025", "text": "Svetlana has a job interview at the council on Wednesday at 3pm. Must message her the night before to wish her luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 3pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t161-026", "text": "Zeynep's sister is getting married in Izmir in May. Zeynep and Mehmet are flying out a week before to help set up. Mehmet is giving a speech at the reception and is already panicking about it. They're staying on for a few days afterwards and might visit his cousins in Ankara.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Izmir", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech at the reception", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p3"}]}
{"id": "t161-027", "text": "Mehmet said the move to the new house went fine, apart from the van turning up two hours late. Their kids love having a garden.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to the new house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love having a garden", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
