{"id": "t161-034", "text": "Lunch with Francesca and Julia today. Francesca is finally leaving the agency at Christmas and going freelance in the new year. Julia has been offered a place on the teaching course in Sheffield starting in September, so she'll be moving up sometime over the summer. We talked about a weekend away before she goes, maybe in June. Need to sort dates with both of them soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a place on the teaching course in Sheffield", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort dates with both of them", "