{"id": "t161-044", "text": "Matilda rang about the house move. Completion has slipped again and is now pencilled in for the 19th, although the solicitor says it could be the week after. If it does happen on the 19th, she'd like me to take the kids that morning so she can deal with the removal men. I'll pick them up at 8 and drop them back after tea. Remind me to check with her on the 17th whether it's still going ahead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "house move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "after tea", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 17th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
