{"id": "t161-059", "text": "Bumped into Julia Moreau at the station. Her husband was made redundant last month and they're thinking about downsizing, maybe sometime next year. She's putting a brave face on it, but she looked exhausted. I should invite her for lunch soon and not mention the house.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia Moreau", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "downsizing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite her for lunch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "not mention the house", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t161-060", "text": "Kenji is calling me on Sunday at 7pm his time, which is 11am here. Must actually be awake for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kenji", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "calling me", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 7pm his time", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11am here", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "be awake", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
